:: OC Enkys Shy at the Mall [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are wandering around the mall not really heading to anything in particular when you suddenly pass an eyesore of a store. Bright pink, smelling of flowers and fruit, and full of frills and clothes in nearly all the same color. Pink. <span style="color:Yellow">You may not be fully against things that are more girly, but there is a time where too much pink is too much pink. It is as you are passing the store that you spy someone familiar inside.</span>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
                Name: "OC Enkys",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Eyes: "Sad",
                    Blush: 1,
            },
        }
        ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

Pink hair, nervous stance. Wait a second, is that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>!? You stop and peer inside the window. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> stands inside, peering at one of the racks full of girls clothing. He looks a bit nervous, holding two shirts up to himself in the mirror. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I wonder if he’ll like this…”</span> He says softly, just loud enough for you to hear. He sighs, looking at the rack and pulling out what appears to be a small dress. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“He did say something like this, but it’s so…”</span> He pauses, looking a little unsure. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That is just your color!”</span> An older girl says, walking up to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> <span style="color:Pink">who quickly blushes and holds the clothing behind his back.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I don’t know who your boyfriend you’re buying this for is, but I know he’ll love it! It matches your hair so well! Girl, you need to tell me who your hairdresser is, because it looks so natural!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">She begins to compliment <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>, running her fingers through his hair and mistaking the feminine boy for a girl.</span> You’d guess she is an employee based on her nametag. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Do you go to my school? You look so familiar, minus the hair. Oh, we have this skirt in the back that would look DIVINE on you! You have GOT to try it on!”</span> 

    <<set _ad to [
        {
                Name: "OC Enkys",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Everyday",
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                    Blush: 3,
            },
        }
        ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:Pink">She grabs <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> and begins to drag him to the changing room as the shy boy panics and tries to free himself.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“P- p- please! I don’t- Aaahhh~!”</span> He is bright red, looking like he is about to have a panic attack as a second employee walks over. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on, you’re scaring the girl!”</span> The older woman says with a chuckle, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Come on dearie, I’ll help you try those on. Don’t worry, I help my daughters get ready for school everyday! They’re about your age, maybe you know them?”</span> The two women swarm <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span>, trying to drag him into the changing room. <span style="color:Pink">Despite his lack of a bulge, you get the feeling that, once they get their hands on him, he’ll either be trying on clothes until they close or they’ll discover he is actually a boy. Neither would end well for the lad. <br>
<br>
With one last cry of embarrassment, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> breaks free and runs out of the store, bright red and feeling utterly humiliated. Seems being mistaken as a cute little girl is too much for him.</span> The two women inside look at each other in confusion and shrug, going back to work. You get the feeling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Enkys</span> will wear something else plus a hat next time he shops here. <br>
<br>
